            "acceptance": "accepted at T0+95 min: 158.630 at 15:05Z is about 43 pips above the 158.20 pre-release shelf (investingLive about 11:00Z, context) and above the 9 Nov D1 high 158.391; T0 and T0+30 min prices are not observed.",
            "base_case": {
              "market_move": "USDJPY holds above the 158.20 pre-release shelf and the broken 158.391 high and climbs through 158.770 toward higher levels before 13 Nov 08:00Z, as US front-end yields stay above flat-to-lower JGB yields.",
