            },
            "confirmations": "(1) BLS core CPI +0.3% m/m against 0.2% consensus; (2) the captured break of the 9 Nov D1 high 158.391 to 158.630 with every USD pair moving USD-up; (3) the JGB 2y down 16 bp over 4-6 Nov while US2Y held 4.51%.",
            "driver": "CLEAR. US front-end yields: USDJPY rose with every USD pair at the capture and on 6 Nov (+0.64% with EURUSD -0.79%); qualified by a 60-day US10Y correlation of 0.28.",
